text:
User request: Send an SMS via Twilio when a webhook fires with a phone number and message
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Webhook Trigger","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/sms-hook"}},{"id":"n2","type":"twilio_sms","label":"Send SMS","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.phone}}","message":"{{trigger.body.message}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"}]}

User request: Every morning at 9am fetch the latest news from an API and email it to me
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Daily 9am","config":{"expression":"0 9 * * *","timezone":"UTC"}},{"id":"n2","type":"http_request","label":"Fetch News","config":{"method":"GET","url":"https://newsapi.org/v2/top-headlines?country=us","authType":"api_key","apiKeyName":"X-Api-Key","apiKeyValue":"YOUR_NEWS_API_KEY"}},{"id":"n3","type":"ai_summarizer","label":"Summarize","config":{"textField":"body","maxLength":200}},{"id":"n4","type":"email_send","label":"Email News","config":{"to":"me@example.com","subject":"Morning News Digest","body":"{{Summarize.summary}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: When a form is submitted via webhook, create a HubSpot contact and send a Slack notification
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Form Submission","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/form"}},{"id":"n2","type":"hubspot_contact","label":"Create Contact","config":{"action":"upsert","email":"{{trigger.body.email}}","firstName":"{{trigger.body.firstName}}","lastName":"{{trigger.body.lastName}}"}},{"id":"n3","type":"slack_message","label":"Slack Notify","config":{"message":"New lead: {{trigger.body.firstName}} {{trigger.body.lastName}} ({{trigger.body.email}})"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Classify incoming support tickets by urgency using AI and route them to different Slack channels
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Ticket Webhook","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/ticket"}},{"id":"n2","type":"ai_text_classifier","label":"Classify Urgency","config":{"text":"{{trigger.body.message}}","categories":"urgent,normal,low"}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_if","label":"Is Urgent?","config":{"field":"category","operator":"equals","value":"urgent"}},{"id":"n4","type":"slack_message","label":"Urgent Channel","config":{"channel":"#urgent-support","message":"🚨 URGENT: {{trigger.body.message}}"}},{"id":"n5","type":"slack_message","label":"Normal Channel","config":{"channel":"#support","message":"New ticket: {{trigger.body.message}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4","label":"true"},{"source":"n3","target":"n5","label":"false"}]}

User request: Build a workflow that takes a webhook payload, runs it through GPT-4 to generate a reply, and sends it back as a webhook response
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Incoming Message","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/chat"}},{"id":"n2","type":"openai_chat","label":"GPT-4 Reply","config":{"model":"gpt-4o","prompt":"You are a helpful customer support agent.","userMessage":"{{trigger.body.message}}","maxTokens":500}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Send Reply","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"reply":"{{GPT-4 Reply.response}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Every hour check a REST API for new orders, filter only paid ones, and save them to the database
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Hourly","config":{"expression":"0 * * * *"}},{"id":"n2","type":"http_request","label":"Fetch Orders","config":{"method":"GET","url":"https://api.mystore.com/orders","authType":"bearer","bearerToken":"YOUR_TOKEN"}},{"id":"n3","type":"transform_filter","label":"Paid Only","config":{"field":"status","operator":"equals","value":"paid"}},{"id":"n4","type":"database_insert","label":"Save Orders","config":{"query":"INSERT INTO orders (id, amount, customer) SELECT id, amount, customer FROM jsonb_populate_recordset(null::orders, $1)"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Send a WhatsApp message when someone fills out a contact form on my website
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Contact Form","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/contact"}},{"id":"n2","type":"twilio_whatsapp","label":"WhatsApp Notify","config":{"to":"whatsapp:+1234567890","from":"whatsapp:+14155238886","message":"New contact from {{trigger.body.name}}: {{trigger.body.message}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"}]}

User request: Translate incoming text from Spanish to English using Google Translate then summarize it with AI
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Text Input","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/translate"}},{"id":"n2","type":"google_translate","label":"Translate","config":{"text":"{{trigger.body.text}}","source":"es","target":"en"}},{"id":"n3","type":"ai_summarizer","label":"Summarize","config":{"textField":"translatedText","maxLength":100}},{"id":"n4","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Result","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"translated":"{{Translate.translatedText}}","summary":"{{Summarize.summary}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Generate a DALL-E image from a prompt sent via webhook and post it to Discord
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Image Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/generate-image"}},{"id":"n2","type":"openai_image","label":"Generate Image","config":{"prompt":"{{trigger.body.prompt}}","model":"dall-e-3","size":"1024x1024"}},{"id":"n3","type":"discord_message","label":"Post to Discord","config":{"content":"🎨 Generated image for: {{trigger.body.prompt}}\n{{Generate Image.imageUrl}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Create a GitHub issue automatically when an error webhook fires from my app
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Error Alert","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/error"}},{"id":"n2","type":"github_create_issue","label":"Create Issue","config":{"owner":"myorg","repo":"myapp","title":"[Auto] Error: {{trigger.body.error}}","body":"**Error:** {{trigger.body.error}}

**Stack:** {{trigger.body.stack}}

**Time:** {{trigger.body.timestamp}}","labels":"bug,automated"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"}]}

User request: Read rows from a Google Sheet every day and send each person a personalized email
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Daily","config":{"expression":"0 8 * * *"}},{"id":"n2","type":"google_sheets_read","label":"Read Sheet","config":{"spreadsheetId":"YOUR_SHEET_ID","range":"Sheet1!A:D"}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_loop","label":"Loop Rows","config":{"field":"rows"}},{"id":"n4","type":"anthropic_chat","label":"Personalize Email","config":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-20250514","systemPrompt":"Write a short personalized email","message":"Name: {{trigger.body.name}}, Company: {{trigger.body.company}}"}},{"id":"n5","type":"email_send","label":"Send Email","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.email}}","subject":"Hello {{trigger.body.name}}","body":"{{Personalize Email.response}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"},{"source":"n4","target":"n5"}]}

User request: When a Stripe payment webhook fires, update a HubSpot deal and notify the sales team on Slack
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Stripe Payment","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/stripe"}},{"id":"n2","type":"hubspot_create_deal","label":"Create Deal","config":{"dealName":"Payment from {{trigger.body.customer_email}}","amount":"{{trigger.body.amount}}","stage":"closedwon"}},{"id":"n3","type":"slack_message","label":"Notify Sales","config":{"channel":"#sales","message":"💰 New payment! ${{trigger.body.amount}} from {{trigger.body.customer_email}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Transcribe an audio file URL using Whisper and save the transcript to Notion
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Audio Upload","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/transcribe"}},{"id":"n2","type":"whisper_transcribe","label":"Transcribe","config":{"audioUrl":"{{trigger.body.audioUrl}}","language":"en"}},{"id":"n3","type":"notion_query","label":"Save to Notion","config":{"databaseId":"YOUR_DATABASE_ID"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Post a tweet automatically every day with an AI-generated motivational quote
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Daily Tweet","config":{"expression":"0 10 * * *"}},{"id":"n2","type":"anthropic_chat","label":"Generate Quote","config":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-20250514","systemPrompt":"Generate a short motivational quote under 280 characters. Return only the quote, no explanation.","message":"Give me today's motivational quote"}},{"id":"n3","type":"twitter_post","label":"Post Tweet","config":{"text":"{{Generate Quote.response}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Build a lead qualification workflow: webhook receives a lead, AI scores it, if score is high create HubSpot contact else send to a nurture Slack channel
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"New Lead","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/lead"}},{"id":"n2","type":"anthropic_chat","label":"Score Lead","config":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-20250514","systemPrompt":"You are a lead scoring assistant. Score this lead 1-10 and respond with JSON: {\"score\": N, \"reason\": \"...\"}.","message":"Company: {{trigger.body.company}}, Title: {{trigger.body.title}}, Message: {{trigger.body.message}}"}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_if","label":"High Score?","config":{"field":"score","operator":"greater_than","value":"7"}},{"id":"n4","type":"hubspot_contact","label":"Create Contact","config":{"action":"create","email":"{{trigger.body.email}}","firstName":"{{trigger.body.name}}"}},{"id":"n5","type":"slack_message","label":"Nurture Queue","config":{"channel":"#nurture","message":"Low score lead: {{trigger.body.email}} (score: {{Score Lead.score}})"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4","label":"true"},{"source":"n3","target":"n5","label":"false"}]}

User request: Upload a file to AWS S3 and then send a Telegram message with the file URL
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"File Upload","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/upload"}},{"id":"n2","type":"aws_s3_upload","label":"Upload to S3","config":{"bucket":"my-bucket","key":"uploads/{{trigger.body.filename}}","content":"{{trigger.body.content}}","region":"us-east-1","contentType":"text/plain"}},{"id":"n3","type":"telegram_send","label":"Telegram Notify","config":{"chatId":"YOUR_CHAT_ID","text":"File uploaded: {{Upload to S3.url}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Run a Python script on incoming data and send the result via email
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Data Input","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/process"}},{"id":"n2","type":"code_python","label":"Process Data","config":{"code":"import json\nresult = {\"processed\": len(data.get(\"items\", [])), \"total\": sum(item.get(\"value\", 0) for item in data.get(\"items\", []))}\n"}},{"id":"n3","type":"email_send","label":"Email Results","config":{"to":"analyst@company.com","subject":"Processing Complete","body":"Processed {{Process Data.result.processed}} items. Total: {{Process Data.result.total}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Query Supabase for all users who signed up this week and send each a welcome email
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Weekly Run","config":{"expression":"0 9 * * 1"}},{"id":"n2","type":"supabase_query","label":"New Users","config":{"table":"users","select":"id,email,name","filter":{"created_at":"gte.now()-interval 7 days"}}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_loop","label":"Loop Users","config":{"field":"rows"}},{"id":"n4","type":"email_send","label":"Welcome Email","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.email}}","subject":"Welcome to Flowa!","body":"Hi {{trigger.body.name}}, welcome aboard!"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Monitor a website every 30 minutes and alert me on Slack if it goes down
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Every 30 min","config":{"expression":"*/30 * * * *"}},{"id":"n2","type":"http_request","label":"Health Check","config":{"method":"GET","url":"https://mywebsite.com/health","timeout":10}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_if","label":"Is Down?","config":{"field":"statusCode","operator":"not_equals","value":"200"}},{"id":"n4","type":"slack_message","label":"Alert Down","config":{"channel":"#ops","message":"🔴 Website DOWN! Status: {{Health Check.statusCode}} at {{trigger.timestamp}}"}},{"id":"n5","type":"console_log","label":"Log OK","config":{"message":"Website UP: {{Health Check.statusCode}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4","label":"true"},{"source":"n3","target":"n5","label":"false"}]}

User request: Invoke an AWS Lambda function when a webhook fires and return its response
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Trigger","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/lambda"}},{"id":"n2","type":"aws_lambda_invoke","label":"Run Lambda","config":{"functionName":"my-processor","payload":"{{trigger.body}}","region":"us-east-1","invocationType":"RequestResponse"}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Result","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":"{{Run Lambda.result}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Search YouTube for a topic and post the top 3 results to a Discord channel
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Search Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/youtube"}},{"id":"n2","type":"youtube_search","label":"YouTube Search","config":{"query":"{{trigger.body.topic}}","maxResults":3}},{"id":"n3","type":"code_javascript","label":"Format Results","config":{"code":"return data.videos.map(v => `${v.title}
${v.url}`).join('

');"}},{"id":"n4","type":"discord_message","label":"Post to Discord","config":{"content":"🎥 Top YouTube results for **{{trigger.body.topic}}**:

{{Format Results.result}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Geocode an address from a webhook and save the coordinates to a PostgreSQL database
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Address Input","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/geocode"}},{"id":"n2","type":"google_maps_geocode","label":"Geocode","config":{"address":"{{trigger.body.address}}"}},{"id":"n3","type":"database_insert","label":"Save Coords","config":{"query":"INSERT INTO locations (address, lat, lng) VALUES ('{{trigger.body.address}}', {{Geocode.lat}}, {{Geocode.lng}})"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Read a CSV file and insert each row into a database
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"CSV Upload","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/import"}},{"id":"n2","type":"csv_parse","label":"Parse CSV","config":{"field":"csv","delimiter":",","hasHeader":"true"}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_loop","label":"Loop Rows","config":{"field":"rows"}},{"id":"n4","type":"database_insert","label":"Insert Row","config":{"query":"INSERT INTO imports (name, email, value) VALUES ('{{trigger.body.name}}', '{{trigger.body.email}}', '{{trigger.body.value}}')"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: When a new Airtable record is created (via webhook), create a LinkedIn post about it
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Airtable Webhook","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/airtable"}},{"id":"n2","type":"anthropic_chat","label":"Write Post","config":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-20250514","systemPrompt":"Write a professional LinkedIn post under 300 characters.","message":"Product: {{trigger.body.fields.Name}}, Description: {{trigger.body.fields.Description}}"}},{"id":"n3","type":"linkedin_post","label":"Post to LinkedIn","config":{"text":"{{Write Post.response}}","visibility":"PUBLIC"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Run an ML model via Hugging Face on incoming text and return the classification
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Text Input","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/classify"}},{"id":"n2","type":"huggingface_inference","label":"HF Classify","config":{"model":"facebook/bart-large-mnli","inputs":"{{trigger.body.text}}","parameters":{"candidate_labels":"positive,negative,neutral"}}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Result","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":"{{HF Classify.result}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Post daily stock prices to a Slack channel using a finance API
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Market Open","config":{"expression":"30 9 * * 1-5","timezone":"America/New_York"}},{"id":"n2","type":"http_request","label":"Get Stock Price","config":{"method":"GET","url":"https://financialmodelingprep.com/api/v3/quote/AAPL","authType":"api_key","apiKeyName":"apikey","apiKeyValue":"YOUR_FMP_KEY"}},{"id":"n3","type":"slack_message","label":"Post Price","config":{"channel":"#stocks","message":"📈 AAPL: ${{Get Stock Price.body.0.price}} ({{Get Stock Price.body.0.changesPercentage}}%)"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Analyze an image URL with Google Vision AI and log the labels
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Image URL","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/analyze"}},{"id":"n2","type":"google_vision","label":"Vision AI","config":{"imageUrl":"{{trigger.body.imageUrl}}","features":"LABEL_DETECTION"}},{"id":"n3","type":"console_log","label":"Log Labels","config":{"message":"Image labels detected"}},{"id":"n4","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Labels","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":"{{Vision AI.annotations}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Deploy my Vercel app after merging a PR and notify the team on Slack
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"GitHub PR Merged","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/github-webhook"}},{"id":"n2","type":"logic_if","label":"Is Merged?","config":{"field":"action","operator":"equals","value":"closed"}},{"id":"n3","type":"vercel_deploy","label":"Deploy","config":{"hookUrl":"https://api.vercel.com/v1/integrations/deploy/YOUR_HOOK"}},{"id":"n4","type":"slack_message","label":"Notify Team","config":{"channel":"#deployments","message":"🚀 Deployed! PR #{{trigger.body.number}} merged by {{trigger.body.sender.login}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3","label":"true"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Read data from Firebase, process it with JavaScript, and write the result to Google Sheets
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_manual","label":"Manual Run"},{"id":"n2","type":"firebase_read","label":"Read Firebase","config":{"databaseUrl":"https://myapp.firebaseio.com","path":"/sales"}},{"id":"n3","type":"code_javascript","label":"Process Data","config":{"code":"const sales = Object.values(data.data || {}); return sales.map(s => [s.date, s.amount, s.customer]);"}},{"id":"n4","type":"google_sheets_write","label":"Write to Sheets","config":{"spreadsheetId":"YOUR_SHEET_ID","range":"Sales!A1","mode":"append","data":"{{Process Data.result}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Track a Mixpanel event every time someone completes a purchase via webhook
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Purchase Complete","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/purchase"}},{"id":"n2","type":"mixpanel_track","label":"Track Event","config":{"event":"Purchase Completed","distinctId":"{{trigger.body.userId}}","properties":{"amount":"{{trigger.body.amount}}","product":"{{trigger.body.product}}","currency":"USD"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"}]}

User request: Create a PayPal payment order from a webhook request and return the approval URL
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Payment Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/pay"}},{"id":"n2","type":"paypal_payment","label":"Create Order","config":{"amount":"{{trigger.body.amount}}","currency":"{{trigger.body.currency}}","description":"{{trigger.body.description}}","sandbox":"true"}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return URL","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"orderId":"{{Create Order.orderId}}","approvalUrl":"{{Create Order.approvalUrl}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Summarize a PDF document from a URL using AI and send the summary via email
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"PDF URL","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/summarize-pdf"}},{"id":"n2","type":"pdf_extract","label":"Extract Text","config":{"fileUrl":"{{trigger.body.pdfUrl}}"}},{"id":"n3","type":"ai_summarizer","label":"Summarize","config":{"textField":"text","maxLength":300}},{"id":"n4","type":"email_send","label":"Email Summary","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.email}}","subject":"PDF Summary Ready","body":"{{Summarize.summary}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Build an Instagram auto-poster: every day generate an AI caption and post with a product image
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Daily Post","config":{"expression":"0 12 * * *"}},{"id":"n2","type":"database_query","label":"Get Product","config":{"query":"SELECT image_url, name, description FROM products ORDER BY RANDOM() LIMIT 1"}},{"id":"n3","type":"anthropic_chat","label":"Generate Caption","config":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-20250514","systemPrompt":"Write an engaging Instagram caption with 3 relevant hashtags.","message":"Product: {{Get Product.rows.0.name}} - {{Get Product.rows.0.description}}"}},{"id":"n4","type":"instagram_post","label":"Post to Instagram","config":{"imageUrl":"{{Get Product.rows.0.image_url}}","caption":"{{Generate Caption.response}}","accountId":"YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Send a Segment analytics event when a user signs up via webhook
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"User Signup","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/signup"}},{"id":"n2","type":"segment_track","label":"Track Signup","config":{"event":"User Signed Up","userId":"{{trigger.body.userId}}","properties":{"email":"{{trigger.body.email}}","plan":"{{trigger.body.plan}}","source":"{{trigger.body.source}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"}]}

User request: Parse incoming XML data from a webhook and store fields in the database
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"XML Webhook","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/xml"}},{"id":"n2","type":"xml_parse","label":"Parse XML","config":{"field":"body"}},{"id":"n3","type":"database_insert","label":"Store Data","config":{"query":"INSERT INTO events (name, value, timestamp) VALUES ('{{Parse XML.parsed.event.name}}', '{{Parse XML.parsed.event.value}}', NOW())"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Create a Google Calendar event when a booking comes in via webhook
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"New Booking","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/booking"}},{"id":"n2","type":"google_calendar_create","label":"Create Event","config":{"summary":"Meeting with {{trigger.body.clientName}}","startTime":"{{trigger.body.startTime}}","endTime":"{{trigger.body.endTime}}","attendees":"{{trigger.body.clientEmail}}","calendarId":"primary"}},{"id":"n3","type":"email_send","label":"Confirm Email","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.clientEmail}}","subject":"Booking Confirmed","body":"Your meeting is confirmed. Calendar invite: {{Create Event.htmlLink}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Query Salesforce for all open opportunities and send a daily digest to the sales manager
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Daily Digest","config":{"expression":"0 8 * * 1-5"}},{"id":"n2","type":"salesforce_query","label":"Open Opps","config":{"query":"SELECT Name, Amount, CloseDate, StageName FROM Opportunity WHERE IsClosed = false ORDER BY CloseDate ASC LIMIT 20","instanceUrl":"https://yourorg.my.salesforce.com"}},{"id":"n3","type":"anthropic_chat","label":"Format Digest","config":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-20250514","systemPrompt":"Format a sales pipeline digest as clean HTML.","message":"{{Open Opps.records}}"}},{"id":"n4","type":"email_send","label":"Email Digest","config":{"to":"sales-manager@company.com","subject":"Daily Pipeline Digest","body":"{{Format Digest.response}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Set a Redis cache key when a user logs in and expire it after 1 hour
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"User Login","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/login"}},{"id":"n2","type":"redis_command","label":"Set Session","config":{"command":"SET","args":"session:{{trigger.body.userId}},{{trigger.body.token}},EX,3600"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"}]}

