{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"API Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/cache"}},{"id":"n2","type":"code_execute","label":"Validate Payload","config":{"language":"javascript","code":"const {key, value} = input.trigger.body; if (!key || !value) throw new Error('key and value required'); return {key, value, valid: true};"}},{"id":"n3","type":"redis_command","label":"Cache Value","config":{"command":"SET","args":["{{Validate Payload.key}}","{{Validate Payload.value}}","EX","3600"]}},{"id":"n4","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Success","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"cached":true,"key":"{{Validate Payload.key}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Invoke an AWS Lambda function when a webhook fires and return its result
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Trigger","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/invoke"}},{"id":"n2","type":"aws_lambda_invoke","label":"Run Lambda","config":{"functionName":"my-processing-function","region":"us-east-1","payload":{"data":"{{trigger.body.data}}","userId":"{{trigger.body.userId}}"}}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Result","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"result":"{{Run Lambda.payload}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Track a custom event in Mixpanel every time a user completes an action via webhook
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"User Action","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/track"}},{"id":"n2","type":"mixpanel_track","label":"Track Event","config":{"event":"{{trigger.body.event}}","distinctId":"{{trigger.body.userId}}","properties":{"plan":"{{trigger.body.plan}}","source":"{{trigger.body.source}}"}}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"OK","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"tracked":true}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Extract text from a PDF URL and summarize it using Claude
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"PDF Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/summarize-pdf"}},{"id":"n2","type":"http_request","label":"Download PDF","config":{"method":"GET","url":"{{trigger.body.pdfUrl}}"}},{"id":"n3","type":"pdf_extract","label":"Extract Text","config":{"pdfData":"{{Download PDF.body}}"}},{"id":"n4","type":"anthropic_chat","label":"Summarize","config":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","prompt":"Summarize the following document in 5 bullet points:","userMessage":"{{Extract Text.text}}","maxTokens":500}},{"id":"n5","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Summary","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"summary":"{{Summarize.response}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"},{"source":"n4","target":"n5"}]}

User request: Post an Instagram photo when a webhook fires with image URL and caption
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Post Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/instagram-post"}},{"id":"n2","type":"instagram_post","label":"Post Image","config":{"imageUrl":"{{trigger.body.imageUrl}}","caption":"{{trigger.body.caption}} #automation"}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Confirm","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"posted":true,"mediaId":"{{Post Image.mediaId}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Accept a PayPal payment webhook and update the order status in the database
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"PayPal Webhook","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/paypal"}},{"id":"n2","type":"logic_if","label":"Payment Completed?","config":{"condition":"{{trigger.body.event_type}} === 'PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED'"}},{"id":"n3","type":"postgres_query","label":"Update Order","config":{"query":"UPDATE orders SET status = 'paid', paid_at = NOW() WHERE paypal_order_id = $1","params":["{{trigger.body.resource.id]}}"]},{"id":"n4","type":"email_send","label":"Receipt Email","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.resource.payer.email_address}}","subject":"Payment Confirmed","body":"Your payment of ${{trigger.body.resource.amount.value}} has been received."}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3","label":"true"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Get data from a REST API, transform it with a code block, then write to Google Sheets
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_manual","label":"Run Manually","config":{}},{"id":"n2","type":"rest_get","label":"Fetch Data","config":{"url":"https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts","headers":{"Accept":"application/json"}}},{"id":"n3","type":"code_execute","label":"Format for Sheets","config":{"language":"javascript","code":"return input['Fetch Data'].body.slice(0,10).map(p => [p.id, p.title, p.body.slice(0,50)]);"}},{"id":"n4","type":"google_sheets_write","label":"Write to Sheet","config":{"spreadsheetId":"YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID","range":"Posts!A2","values":"{{Format for Sheets.result}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Build a retry workflow that retries a failing HTTP request up to 3 times before alerting
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Trigger","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/retry-test"}},{"id":"n2","type":"logic_retry","label":"Retry on Fail","config":{"maxAttempts":3,"waitMs":2000}},{"id":"n3","type":"http_request","label":"Call API","config":{"method":"POST","url":"{{trigger.body.url}}","body":"{{trigger.body.payload}}"}},{"id":"n4","type":"slack_send","label":"Alert on Failure","config":{"channel":"#errors","text":"API call failed after 3 retries: {{trigger.body.url}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4","label":"error"}]}

User request: Run two API calls in parallel and merge their results
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Start","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/parallel"}},{"id":"n2","type":"logic_parallel","label":"Run in Parallel","config":{"branches":2}},{"id":"n3","type":"http_request","label":"API Call A","config":{"method":"GET","url":"https://api.service-a.com/data"}},{"id":"n4","type":"http_request","label":"API Call B","config":{"method":"GET","url":"https://api.service-b.com/data"}},{"id":"n5","type":"transform_merge","label":"Merge Results","config":{"inputs":["{{API Call A.body}}","{{API Call B.body]}}","mode":"shallow"]}},{"id":"n6","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Combined","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":"{{Merge Results.merged}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3","label":"branch1"},{"source":"n2","target":"n4","label":"branch2"},{"source":"n3","target":"n5"},{"source":"n4","target":"n5"},{"source":"n5","target":"n6"}]}

User request: Geocode an address from a webhook and return latitude and longitude
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Address Input","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/geocode"}},{"id":"n2","type":"google_maps_geocode","label":"Geocode Address","config":{"address":"{{trigger.body.address}}"}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Coords","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"lat":"{{Geocode Address.lat}}","lng":"{{Geocode Address.lng}}","formattedAddress":"{{Geocode Address.formattedAddress}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Post a Reddit submission when a webhook fires with title and content
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Post Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/reddit"}},{"id":"n2","type":"reddit_post","label":"Submit Post","config":{"subreddit":"{{trigger.body.subreddit}}","title":"{{trigger.body.title}}","text":"{{trigger.body.content}}","kind":"self"}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Confirm","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"posted":true,"url":"{{Submit Post.url}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Upload a file to Google Drive from a webhook and share the link via email
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"File Upload","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/drive-upload"}},{"id":"n2","type":"google_drive_upload","label":"Upload to Drive","config":{"name":"{{trigger.body.filename}}","mimeType":"{{trigger.body.mimeType}}","content":"{{trigger.body.content}}","folderId":"YOUR_FOLDER_ID"}},{"id":"n3","type":"email_send","label":"Share Link","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.email}}","subject":"Your file is ready","body":"Here is your file: {{Upload to Drive.webViewLink}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: When a new GitHub issue is opened, add a label and post to Slack
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"GitHub Issue","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/github-issue"}},{"id":"n2","type":"logic_if","label":"New Issue?","config":{"condition":"{{trigger.body.action}} === 'opened'"}},{"id":"n3","type":"http_request","label":"Add Label","config":{"method":"POST","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/{{trigger.body.repository.full_name}}/issues/{{trigger.body.issue.number}}/labels","headers":{"Authorization":"Bearer YOUR_GITHUB_TOKEN"},"body":{"labels":["needs-triage"]}}},{"id":"n4","type":"slack_send","label":"Notify Team","config":{"channel":"#engineering","text":"New issue: {{trigger.body.issue.title}} {{trigger.body.issue.html_url}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3","label":"true"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: When a Stripe subscription is cancelled, update the database and send a win-back email
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Stripe Event","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/stripe-events"}},{"id":"n2","type":"logic_if","label":"Subscription Cancelled?","config":{"condition":"{{trigger.body.type}} === 'customer.subscription.deleted'"}},{"id":"n3","type":"postgres_query","label":"Update User","config":{"query":"UPDATE users SET plan='free', cancelled_at=NOW() WHERE stripe_customer_id=$1","params":["{{trigger.body.data.object.customer]}}"]},{"id":"n4","type":"logic_delay","label":"Wait 1 Day","config":{"duration":1,"unit":"days"}},{"id":"n5","type":"email_send","label":"Win-back Email","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.data.object.customer_email}}","subject":"We miss you!","body":"We noticed you cancelled. Here's 30% off to come back: WINBACK30"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3","label":"true"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"},{"source":"n4","target":"n5"}]}

User request: Trigger a Vercel deployment when code is pushed and notify Slack of success or failure
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"GitHub Push","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/deploy"}},{"id":"n2","type":"vercel_deploy","label":"Deploy to Vercel","config":{"projectId":"YOUR_PROJECT_ID","teamId":"YOUR_TEAM_ID","ref":"{{trigger.body.ref]}"}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_if","label":"Deploy Success?","config":{"condition":"{{Deploy to Vercel.state}} === 'READY'"}},{"id":"n4","type":"slack_send","label":"Success","config":{"channel":"#deploys","text":"Deployed successfully: {{Deploy to Vercel.url}}"}},{"id":"n5","type":"slack_send","label":"Failed","config":{"channel":"#deploys","text":"Deploy failed for {{trigger.body.ref}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4","label":"true"},{"source":"n3","target":"n5","label":"false"}]}

User request: Build an onboarding workflow that sends 3 emails over 3 days when a user signs up
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"User Signup","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/onboard"}},{"id":"n2","type":"email_send","label":"Day 1 Welcome","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.email}}","subject":"Welcome to Flowa!","body":"Hi {{trigger.body.name}}, welcome! Here's how to get started."}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_delay","label":"Wait 1 Day","config":{"duration":1,"unit":"days"}},{"id":"n4","type":"email_send","label":"Day 2 Tips","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.email}}","subject":"Pro tips for Flowa","body":"Hi {{trigger.body.name}}, here are some power-user tips!"}},{"id":"n5","type":"logic_delay","label":"Wait 1 More Day","config":{"duration":1,"unit":"days"}},{"id":"n6","type":"email_send","label":"Day 3 Check-in","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.email}}","subject":"How's it going?","body":"Hi {{trigger.body.name}}, any questions? Reply to this email!"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"},{"source":"n4","target":"n5"},{"source":"n5","target":"n6"}]}

User request: Read Firebase data on a schedule and send changed records to a Slack channel
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Hourly Check","config":{"expression":"0 * * * *"}},{"id":"n2","type":"firebase_read","label":"Read Firebase","config":{"path":"/orders","orderBy":"updatedAt","limitToLast":10}},{"id":"n3","type":"transform_filter","label":"Recent Changes","config":{"field":"status","operator":"equals","value":"pending"}},{"id":"n4","type":"slack_send","label":"Report Changes","config":{"channel":"#ops","text":"{{Recent Changes.count}} pending orders found"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Build a GraphQL query workflow that fetches user data and saves it to Notion
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Sync Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/sync-user"}},{"id":"n2","type":"graphql_query","label":"Fetch User","config":{"endpoint":"https://api.myapp.com/graphql","query":"query GetUser($id: ID!) { user(id: $id) { id name email plan } }","variables":{"id":"{{trigger.body.userId}}"}}},{"id":"n3","type":"notion_database","label":"Save to Notion","config":{"databaseId":"YOUR_DB_ID","properties":{"Name":{"title":[{"text":{"content":"{{Fetch User.data.user.name}}"}}]},"Email":{"email":"{{Fetch User.data.user.email}}"},"Plan":{"select":{"name":"{{Fetch User.data.user.plan}}"}}}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Send a weekly performance report by querying Postgres and emailing results
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Friday 5pm","config":{"expression":"0 17 * * 5"}},{"id":"n2","type":"postgres_query","label":"Get Weekly Stats","config":{"query":"SELECT date_trunc('day', created_at) as day, count(*) as events, sum(revenue) as revenue FROM analytics WHERE created_at >= NOW() - INTERVAL '7 days' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1"}},{"id":"n3","type":"ai_summarize","label":"Format Report","config":{"text":"{{Get Weekly Stats.rows}}","prompt":"Format this as a concise weekly performance report"}},{"id":"n4","type":"email_send","label":"Send Report","config":{"to":"management@company.com","subject":"Weekly Performance Report","body":"{{Format Report.summary}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Use Claude to write and send a weekly newsletter email to all subscribers
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Every Sunday","config":{"expression":"0 9 * * 0"}},{"id":"n2","type":"postgres_query","label":"Get Subscribers","config":{"query":"SELECT email, name FROM subscribers WHERE active = true"}},{"id":"n3","type":"http_request","label":"Get News","config":{"method":"GET","url":"https://newsapi.org/v2/top-headlines?country=us&apiKey=YOUR_KEY"}},{"id":"n4","type":"anthropic_chat","label":"Write Newsletter","config":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","prompt":"Write an engaging weekly newsletter about these news stories. Under 400 words.","userMessage":"{{Get News.body.articles}}","maxTokens":600}},{"id":"n5","type":"loop_for_each","label":"Send to Each","config":{"items":"{{Get Subscribers.rows}}"}},{"id":"n6","type":"email_send","label":"Send Newsletter","config":{"to":"{{$json.email}}","subject":"Your Weekly Update","body":"Hi {{$json.name}},\n\n{{Write Newsletter.response}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n1","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"},{"source":"n2","target":"n5"},{"source":"n4","target":"n5"},{"source":"n5","target":"n6"}]}

User request: Format a date from a webhook and send a reminder email 7 days before the deadline
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Deadline Set","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/deadline"}},{"id":"n2","type":"date_time","label":"Calculate Reminder Date","config":{"operation":"subtract","date":"{{trigger.body.deadline}}","amount":7,"unit":"days","outputFormat":"ISO"}},{"id":"n3","type":"logic_delay","label":"Wait Until Reminder","config":{"until":"{{Calculate Reminder Date.result}}"}},{"id":"n4","type":"email_send","label":"Reminder Email","config":{"to":"{{trigger.body.email}}","subject":"Deadline in 7 days: {{trigger.body.taskName}}","body":"This is a reminder that '{{trigger.body.taskName}}' is due on {{trigger.body.deadline}}."}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Respond to a webhook immediately then process data asynchronously
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Incoming Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/async-process"}},{"id":"n2","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Immediate ACK","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"status":"accepted","message":"Processing started"}}},{"id":"n3","type":"http_request","label":"Heavy Processing","config":{"method":"POST","url":"https://api.myservice.com/process","body":"{{trigger.body}}"}},{"id":"n4","type":"slack_send","label":"Notify Done","config":{"channel":"#ops","text":"Processing complete for job {{trigger.body.jobId}}"}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n1","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"}]}

User request: Calculate compound interest using a math node and return the result
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Calculation Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/compound-interest"}},{"id":"n2","type":"math_operation","label":"Calculate Interest","config":{"expression":"{{trigger.body.principal}} * Math.pow(1 + {{trigger.body.rate}} / 100, {{trigger.body.years}})"}},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Return Result","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"finalAmount":"{{Calculate Interest.result}}"}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Log all incoming webhook requests to a database for auditing
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_webhook","label":"Any Request","config":{"method":"POST","path":"/audit"}},{"id":"n2","type":"postgres_query","label":"Log Request","config":{"query":"INSERT INTO audit_log (method, body, headers, created_at) VALUES ($1, $2, $3, NOW())","params":["POST","{{trigger.body}}","{{trigger.headers]}}"]},{"id":"n3","type":"respond_webhook","label":"Confirm","config":{"statusCode":200,"body":{"logged":true}}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"}]}

User request: Query a REST API every hour and only alert if the response count changes since last check
Valid workflow JSON example:
{"nodes":[{"id":"n1","type":"trigger_cron","label":"Every Hour","config":{"expression":"0 * * * *"}},{"id":"n2","type":"http_request","label":"Check API","config":{"method":"GET","url":"https://api.myapp.com/counts"}},{"id":"n3","type":"redis_command","label":"Get Last Count","config":{"command":"GET","args":["api:last_count"]}},{"id":"n4","type":"logic_if","label":"Count Changed?","config":{"condition":"'{{Check API.body.total}}' !== '{{Get Last Count.result}}'"}},{"id":"n5","type":"slack_send","label":"Alert Change","config":{"channel":"#alerts","text":"Count changed: {{Get Last Count.result}} to {{Check API.body.total}}"}},{"id":"n6","type":"redis_command","label":"Update Cache","config":{"command":"SET","args":["api:last_count","{{Check API.body.total}}","EX","7200"]}}],"edges":[{"source":"n1","target":"n2"},{"source":"n2","target":"n3"},{"source":"n3","target":"n4"},{"source":"n4","target":"n5","label":"true"},{"source":"n4","target":"n6"},{"source":"n5","target":"n6"}]}

Variable expressions use double curly braces: {{expression}}.
- Webhook input: {{trigger.body.fieldName}} or {{trigger.headers.Authorization}}
- Current node input: {{$json.field}} or {{$json.nested.field}}
- Previous node output: {{NodeLabel.outputField}} or {{$node["Node Label"].json.field}}
- Loop item: {{$json.email}} inside a loop_for_each
- Query params: {{trigger.query.page}}
- Environment: use stored credentials, not raw secrets in config.
